<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 142.28 mln rand SAfrica bonds Thurs.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 142.28 mln rand SAfrica bonds Thurs.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 142.28 million rands worth of South African bonds on Friday after selling 68.35 million rands on Thursday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
